        "label": "19.5",
        "text": "A kid slides down a slide of the shape y = 2 /x . Assume y ( t ) = − 7 . What is ′ ′ ′ 2 x ( t )? Evaluate it at x = 1. Solution: differentiate the relation to get y = − 2 x /x . ′ ′ ′ 2 Now solve for x to get x = − y x / 2 = 7 / 2."
